<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bravo!\rA promising youngblood about to start\nthe journey of archaeology just\fwalked in!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? Just a visitor?\nOh, aight...\fYou got me hype for nothin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My staff here at the Research Center\nis top tier, and the research\fgoes good with zero effort\ffrom me.\rGot questions? Ask\nmy staff!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We cracked a lot of the UNOWN\nmystery thanks to you!\rGood looks, fr.\nGood looks again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The ruins is like 1,500 years old.\nThat’s all we know.\rNobody know why they got\nbuilt... or who built ’em.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you caught a UNOWN?\nThat’s huge!\rNow that I think about it... why we\nall of a sudden seein’ UNOWN?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta hear this!\nThis a BIG discovery!\rYou solved the stone-panel puzzle\nthat made UNOWN show up.\rThem tablets is the key to wakin’\nup the UNOWN!\rStill... Why would anybody make\na key like that?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta hear this!\nThis a BIG discovery!\rTurn on the radio in the ruins\nand you pick up weird radio waves!\rThat’s proof UNOWN talk to each\nother usin’ radio waves!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta hear this!\nThis a BIG discovery!\rThere’s as many UNOWN as there is\nletters in the alphabet!\rWe confirmed 26 kinds.\nWhy don’t you catch ’em all?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How you like the UNOWN Report\nI gave you?\rIt log UNOWN as you catch ’em.\nPretty useful!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta hear this!\nThis a BIG discovery!\rWe figured out UNOWN go in a\ncertain order!\fLemme see your report.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There!\nI put the UNOWN in the right order!\fMaybe we learn more about ’em now.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What?\nYou found a room with UNOWN symbols?\fThat’s a BIG discovery!\rWe on it right now.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta hear this!\nThis a BIG discovery!\rWe found two new UNOWN symbols!\rThat mean...\nThere’s two more kinds of UNOWN\fout there somewhere...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta hear this!\nWe learnin’ more and more about the\fsymbols on the floor!\r...Looks like UNOWN used to live at\nthe ruins with a human clan.\rWe think that clan made the\nhomie statues underground.\rThe UNOWN was real jumpy and\nwouldn’t go outside.\rWhen more and more people started\nshowin’ up around the ruins, the clan\fthat wanted peace with the UNOWN\fended up leavin’...\rThanks to our research and your\nhelp, we cracked a lotta their\fmystery!\rStill a whole lot we don’t know,\nof course.\rArchaeology never end.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll let you know if I find out\nanything else.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} opened the UNOWN Report\nand took notes!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thanks to our research and your\nhelp, we cracked a lotta their\fmystery!\rStill a whole lot we don’t know,\nof course.\rArchaeology never end.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s weird patterns drawn on the\nwalls of the ruins.\rThey gotta be the key to crackin’\nthe mystery of the ruins.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The weird homies you saw in\nthe ruins?\rThey look a lot like the\ndrawings on the walls.\rHmm...\rThat mean there gotta be\nmad different kinds of ’em...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nIt look like I’m doin’ nothin’?\rCome on!\nI might not look it, but I’m the one\fwho made the UNOWN Report!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ruins of Alph\nExploration Year 10. Still Lost.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mystery Homie\nName: UNOWN\fA total of 26 kinds found.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ruins of Alph Research Report\rI dedicate this report to the\nResearch Center’s founder,\fProfessor Silktree... RIP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0073_D24R0102_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a bunch of nerd books.\r“Mysteries of the Ancients”\n“Code-Breaking for Dummies”\f“Weathering Ruins”</language>
	</row>
</body>
